{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11307130","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11307130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130713001:1":{"text":"하… 크림슨 고원에 보물이 있다는 소문이 퍼진 뒤로, 근처의 부족민들이 하나둘씩 실종되고 있어.","source_cn":"唉，自从深红高原传出宝藏传说后，附近部族不少族民外出后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09490E0D969028FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130713002:1":{"text":"들리는 말로는 전부 사막의 발톱의 짓이라고 하던데…","source_cn":"有人说，他们都是被流沙之爪的那帮强盗抓走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE26D49E78097F534","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130713003:1":{"text":"만약 사막의 발톱이 내 딸한테 피해를 준다면, 난 그들과 목숨을 걸고 싸울 거네!","source_cn":"但是，如果流沙之爪真的敢伤害我的女儿，我一定会和他们拼命的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7B81C094B22AADE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130713004:1":{"text":"이제 내겐 타라만 남았어. 어떻게든 지켜야 해!","source_cn":"我只剩下小塔拉了，无论如何都要保护好她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x938BED7EA87E6AA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:部落成员登利":{"text":"덴리","source":"部落成员登利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}